ersation</dt><dd>2099908603012432335</dd>\n</dl>"},"2099913045099364555":{"a":"<p>It&#x27;s exactly like growing but from the outside in.<br>\n<a href=\"https://t.co/r2Tb8UKe2B\">t.co</a></p>\n<p>One of the most important tricks a tree cam do is siphon water 100 ft vertically. Impossible in an open system. Straw, plumbing, etc. Not good enough. Trees start by creating a vacuum vessel and then growing up, up and away from the ground.</p>\n<p>This way the system is technically in hard vacuum and the water surface tension forces it to fan out evenly. Static negative pressure renders gravity irrelevant, mathematically. Static logarithmically overwhelms gravity in scale. God powers from above.</p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/m_QhY1aABsE?enablejsapi=1\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m_QhY1aABsE\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2099652305284895216\">https://x.com/i/status/2099652305284895216</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2099913045099364555</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2099913045099364555\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-09-15T17:27:39.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2099431609128624347</dd>\n</dl>"},"2099914545145811425":{"a":"<p>If you cut the tree branch the vacuum is permanently broken. Is a permanent injury. Don&#x27;t cut tree branches. Theroots are an exact mirror of branches. Trees can grow new capillaries from the ground up inside just like your blood vessels. It takes time to grow. Very much time.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2099913045099364555\">https://x.com/i/status/2099913045099364555</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2099914545145811425</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2099914545145811425\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-09-15T17:33:36.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2099431609128624347</dd>\n</dl>"},"2099933915179848168":{"a":"<p>Video above is what you may see at these interchanges of the highway when you see this on radar. War Bows. Shielding from cosmic radiation. <a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2099933915179848168\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2099933915179848168\">View video on X</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2099933915179848168\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2099933915179848168</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2099822665179566105\">https://x.com/i/status/2099822665179566105</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2099933915179848168</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2099933915179848168\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-09-15T18:50:34.000Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>2099822665179566105</dd>\n</dl>"},"2099961367826457086":{"a":"<p>This Old Bastard Really Don&#x27;t Care | Dark Country #countrymusic #songwri... <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a